    <ul>
      <li><strong>True privacy</strong> — No email reading, no phone number collection, no data monetization. Read our <a href="/privacy-model/">privacy model</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>AI portfolio doctor</strong> — Ask questions about portfolio overlap, sector concentration, and risk in plain English. <a href="/ask-ai-investment-assistant/">Learn more →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Family wealth aggregation</strong> — Track Self, Spouse, Parents, Children under one account. Free. <a href="/blog/how-to-track-family-portfolio-india/">Guide →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Free financial tools</strong> — <a href="/tools/xirr-calculator/">XIRR calculator</a>, <a href="/tools/mutual-fund-overlap/">fund overlap checker</a>, <a href="/tools/ltcg-stcg-calculator/">tax calculator</a>, and more.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>When should you stay with INDmoney?</h2>
    <p>INDmoney is genuinely useful if you want a single app for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>US stock investing (Vested integration)</li>
      <li>Applying for loans, credit cards, or insurance</li>
      <li>Fully automatic tracking without uploading any files</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If your priority is <strong>privacy, accuracy, and unbiased portfolio analytics</strong> without the cross-selling, Arthavi is the better fit.</p>

    <h2>How to switch from INDmoney to Arthavi?</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Download your latest CAS from <a href="/guides/how-to-import-cas-cams-kfintech-nsdl/">CAMS or KFintech</a> (free, takes 2 minutes)</li>
      <li>Create a free <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register">Arthavi account</a> — no phone number required</li>
      <li>Upload your CAS PDF — full portfolio appears in 30 seconds</li>
      <li>Revoke INDmoney's Gmail access from <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google account permissions</a></li>
    </ol>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;">
      <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/demo" class="btn btn-demo" style="padding: 1rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">
        Try Arthavi Demo — No Signup Required
